    {
      "id": "r20261022-a01",
      "title": "Miko's First Day at Work",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "Miko is twenty-two years old. Yesterday was his first day at a small coffee shop in Bandung. He woke up at five in the morning because he did not want to be late.",
        "At the shop, his boss, Mrs. Ani, showed him how to make coffee and use the cash register. Miko was nervous at first, but the other workers were friendly and helped him a lot.",
        "At the end of the day, Mrs. Ani said, \"Good job, Miko!\" He felt very happy. Tomorrow he will learn how to make latte art."
      ],
